{
  "file" : "npc/quests/quests_geffen.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "You've never heard of me? Why, I'm the Veteran Blacksmith of this land. I've spent 30 years in this hot and bloody hellfire, bending steel to my iron will!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "But..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "I am growing older and my prowess begins to fade with age. So I've invented something for young, hot, upcoming Blacksmiths, in hopes that they too will master my craft..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "We Blacksmiths must always manipulate steel under extreme heat, and the hot air and melted metals are more than most people can stand."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "For the sake of our craft, our beautiful, yet masculine faces are put at risk..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "But with this wonder of technology, there's no need to worry! Behold, the ^3355FFWelding Mask^000000 !!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "It works by covering your face with a fat metal plate. Truly, it's an item that everyone should want! If not yourself, it'd be a good idea to give this to a friend who is studying smithing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "So how about it ? If you give me ^2244FF50 Steel^000000 and ^4422FFonly 2000 Zeny^000000, I will make it for you right away~!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "Hm... Not bad. Alright."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "How does it work again?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "Ah, I see that you appreciate a Blacksmith's work! Alright, I'll do it right away !!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "Hahaha~! Make good use of that!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "Hmmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "You do not have the items I require."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "A common Blacksmith would interpret this as a sign of disrepect, but I will forgive you. Just don't forget what I need if you want me to make you this mask."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "The ^3355FFWelding Mask^000000 protects your face by covering it with a fat metal plate. This invention is the result of 30 years of endless toil at the hammer and anvil."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "Ah...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "I guess this is the first time you've met a Blacksmith as great as me, and you're just speechless with awe. Please, take your time and speak up when you are ready."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "^3355FFThis guy seems"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "a little full"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "text" : "of himself.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Please listen"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "to my story"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "of my blessed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "grandfather."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Talk"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Ask about Items needed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Manufacture"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Quit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "My Grandfather, who passed away a few years ago, was special to me. He always stayed with me, and took care of me. He was much better than my old man, who was always busy working."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "To me, Grandfather's library was always like a fantasy land where I could escape. I spent most of my time there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "I learned a lot of things from his books in the Library. Grandfather was interested in Alchemy and Music, and his Library was filled with many mysterious old books."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "One day..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "As usual, I went to the Library and discovered an interesting schematic."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "It showed some instrument which looked like Ear Muffs that, when worn on the head, could transmit music or whispers to the ears through a thin wire."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "I guess..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "It is my grand father's unfinished work. I met a few Alchemists and asked them to produce it, but they rejected my offer..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "In the end, I thought 'I've gotta make it myself.' So I researched for a few years, and now I fully understand how to make that thing. But, I could never gather the materials to make it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "If I can get those articles, I would build it right away. If you are interested in my idea, would you bring them for me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "All I wanna do is build this thing in honor of my grandfather and finish the work he started. If you ask me to keep it, I wouldn't mind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "40 ^3355FFSteel^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFOridecon^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFAlcohol^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFCoal^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "These are the things I need for Grandfather's masterpiece."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "*Tap! Tap! Tap!*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Because of you, I could accomplish my grandfather's wish. He would be happy if he looked down on me from Heaven."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "As I said, please take this. I am just proud that I can make this by myself."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Thank you for trying to help me, but you didn't bring all the items I need. I think you will find them all soon though."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "[Eric]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "N-no?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Well..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "You have your own"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "worries, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "text" : "Farewell."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Hello, I'm Nia, the fifth"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "disciple of Mawong, the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "gaming mastermind. Now,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "how would you like to play a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Number Match game with me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Number Match Game?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Practice Number Match"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Play Number Match"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Record Holder"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Ah, well, the objective of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "the Number Match game is to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "guess the number I'm thinking"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "of. Of course, there are a few"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "rules that limit the numbers"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "that I can choose from."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "All the numbers that I make"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "up must be 3 digits, I can't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "use 0 for any of the digits,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "and I can't use the same"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "number for any of the digits"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "more than once."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "So, for example, I can't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "use the numbers 103, 112,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "252, or 701. Those numbers"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "either have a 0, or they use"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "the same number in the digits"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "more than once. Got it now?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Now, you only get 5 guesses,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "and after each guess, I'll tell"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "you how many digits you guessed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "correctly, followed by the number of correctly guessed digits in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "the correct digit place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "For example, let's say the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "number I come up with is 168."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "If your first guess is 678, then you guessed two of the digits,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "6 and 8, correctly. However,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "only 8 is in the correct place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "You know, it'd be a good idea"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "if you try the Practice Mode"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "first. Then, when you're more"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "comfortable, play the actual"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Number Match game. Don't forget that speed counts for your score!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Ah, if you happen to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "make a new record in the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Number Match game, you'll"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "have your name recorded,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "so don't miss this chance for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "fame and maybe even fortune~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "[Nia]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Nia",
      "text" : "Great, let's do a practice"
    },
    {
